From: Ian <219239532+markd3ng@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 11:38:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(frontend): classify upload result panel from content
 kind
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Context:
Production Patch 140 smoke PiEB on pastebin-prod
ab149c40-912c-4603-b7dc-eaa86a449813 persisted ft-defect-01-smoke.bin
and served exact bytes on raw/?a, but the result panel treated it as
text (Display /d/PiEB primary, QR → Display). storedMimeTypeForUpload()
intentionally omits metadata.mimeType when the filename already maps to
a MIME type. The frontend incorrectly used that omitted mimeType as
TEXT vs FILE.

Expected behavior:
- sourceKind comes from editorState.editKind (edit → text, file → file).
- Unencrypted File-tab uploads, including notes.txt and omitted mimeType,
  show Download /<name>?a as primary; QR encodes ?a.
- Text-editor uploads stay Display-primary even with a .txt filename.
- Encrypted File-tab share remains /d/<name>#<key>; never ?key=.
- Known filename extensions may still omit stored mimeType while raw
  Content-Type is derived from the filename.

Acceptance criteria:
- File-tab .bin/.png/.pdf/.txt/unknown/ZIP with absent or text MIME → ?a
- Text editor → Display primary, no synthetic Download URL
- Encrypted file → fragment key only
- QR tests compare the rendered SVG to the expected URL encoding
- Worker product-code delta: none

Constraints:
- Generic Pastebin patch 150; do not rewrite Patch 140.
- Do not change storedMimeTypeForUpload() or PasteResponse schema.
- Do not merge into upstream-sync.
- Do not deploy pastebin-prod.

Validation:
- RED: 10 failing File-tab / sourceKind tests on 6ac36888 (22 targeted: 10 fail / 12 pass)
- GREEN: pnpm exec vitest run — 33 files / 259 tests PASS
- pnpm lint PASS
- pnpm typecheck PASS (after pnpm build:frontend)
- pnpm build:frontend PASS
- wrangler deploy --dry-run PASS
- TDD: RED → GREEN recorded

